  "solution": {
    "text": "Amino group of glutamine is acetylated. Amide group of glutamine is not acetylated. Note :\nAcetylation of amide requires activation of amides and /or acyl donors, since the nitrogen atom of amides is less basic than that of the corresponding amines due to amide resonance.",
